roke farmate the yeh sibte payamber abbas<br>
ab na qasim hain na akber hain asghar abbas<br>
koi baqi na raha humdam-o- yawar abbas<br>
dasht-e- ghurbat main luta mera bhara ghar abbas<br>
jane zehra-o-ali janne baradar abbas<br>
<br>
1. bekasi sarf-e-buka chashme aza nouha kuna<br>
hasrat-o-yaas kare gham main teri aaho fugan<br>
khoon-e-dil khoon-e-jigar hain meri ankhon se rawan<br>
al madad aye pisar-e-fatahe khaibar abbas<br>
<br>
2. khake sine pe sina margaya akber mera<br>
hogaya dasht-o-bayaba ki tarha ghar mera<br>
juz alam koi nahi monis-o-yawar mera<br>
meri tanhayi pe khush hain yeh sitamgar abbas<br>
<br>
3. chashme tanhayi main pinha hain qayamat ka sama<br>
asr ka lamha-e-akhir tabar-o-tegh-o-sina<br>
kund khanjar yeh gala maa meri masruf-e-buka<br>
koun dekhega qayamat ka ye manzar abbas<br>
<br>
4.mera abbas mera khuvat-e-bazoo mera chain<br>
jiske marne se adoo khush hain haram karte hai bain<br>
har ghadi saniye zehra se yeh kehte the hussain<br>
tha behan ek mukamal mera lashkar abbas<br>
<br>
5. hai mere pesh-e-nazar shaam-e- ghariba ka sama<br>
be rida zainab-o-kulsum woh khaimo ka dhuwa<br>
aur beemar ko pehnayege yeh tokh-e-gara<br>
qatl ke baad mere hoga yeh mehshar abbas<br>
<br>
6. shai yeh kehte the farid ab mera jarar nahi<br>
dil giraftar-e-alam hai mera ghamqaar nahi<br>
shaan thi jis se alam ki wo alamdar nahi<br>
kise fariyad kare sibte payambar abbas<br>
jane zehra-o-ali janne baradar abbas